      <Comment source="O-27, pujar">A root expressed AMT gene encodes a functional ammonium transporter with a possible role in the primary uptake of ammonium. Under nitrogen deficient conditions, T DNA insertion lines with loss of AMT1.1, showed a 30% decrease in high-affinity influx of ammonium |CITS: [17026539]|.</Comment>
