      <Xref identifier="P54144" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="215" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="O-27, pujar">A root expressed gene encodes a ammonium transporter in |FRAME: TAX-3702|. T-DNA insertion lacking this gene showed a loss of high-affinity |FRAME: AMMONIUM| influx by approximately 30%. Along with AMT1.1, AMT1.3 is upregulated under nitrogen deficient conditions. They exert an additive contribution to the overall ammonium uptake capacity in |FRAME: TAX-3702| under |FRAME: AMMONIUM| deficient conditions |CITS: [17026539]|.</Comment>
